{"seq":2,"slug":"data-replication-sync","title":"数据复制与同步技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/disaster-recovery-business-continuity/data-protection/data-replication-sync","wordCount":2444,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据复制与同步技术\">数据复制与同步技术</h1><p>当<a href=\"backup-strategies\">备份策略</a>将 RPO 压缩到小时级时，增量备份的快照间隔就是丢失窗口的下限。要将 RPO 进一步压缩到分钟级乃至零，必须从&quot;定期快照&quot;转向&quot;持续复制&quot;——这是一个根本不同的工程问题。数据复制不再是&quot;拷贝文件&quot;，而是在分布式系统中维护多个数据副本之间的一致性关系。本文从复制的基本模型出发，深入讨论同步与异步复制的工程权衡、主流云平台的实现差异，以及跨区域场景下不可避免的物理延迟约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数据复制是把 RPO 从小时级压到秒级/零的手段，其全部工程权衡围绕一组基本概念展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>同步 vs 异步复制</strong>：同步复制换取零 RPO，代价是写入延迟随距离上升；异步复制保持低延迟，但复制延迟窗口内的数据在切换时可能丢失。</li>\n<li><strong>延迟的物理极限</strong>：光纤中光速决定了两区域间的最小 RTT，同步复制仅适用于 RTT &lt; 5–10ms 的距离，跨区域必须接受异步复制。</li>\n<li><strong>复制拓扑</strong>：单主（无冲突、写入瓶颈）、多主（就近写、需解冲冲突）、无主（quorum、高可用）——拓扑决定了冲突处理的复杂度。</li>\n<li><strong>冲突解决策略</strong>：LWW、版本向量、CRDT、应用层合并，各在&quot;简单 vs 不丢数据&quot;之间取舍。</li>\n<li><strong>实际 RPO = 故障时刻的复制延迟</strong>：副本落后主节点的时间差直接等于切换时真正会丢失的数据量。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>核心命题：<strong>复制不是免费午餐——每一次 RPO 压缩都以延迟增加、一致性复杂度上升、网络成本扩大为代价。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"同步复制与异步复制-核心权衡\">同步复制与异步复制：核心权衡</h2><p>数据复制的两种基本模型对应着一个不可调和的权衡：<strong>一致性 vs 延迟</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Client&#10;    participant Primary&#10;    participant Replica&#10;    Note over Primary,Replica: 同步复制&#10;    Client-&gt;&gt;Primary: WRITE&#10;    Primary-&gt;&gt;Replica: 转发 WAL&#10;    Replica--&gt;&gt;Primary: ACK 已持久化&#10;    Primary--&gt;&gt;Client: COMMIT 成功&#10;    Note over Primary,Replica: 异步复制&#10;    Client-&gt;&gt;Primary: WRITE&#10;    Primary--&gt;&gt;Client: COMMIT 成功&#10;    Primary-&gt;&gt;Replica: 后台转发 WAL&#10;    Replica--&gt;&gt;Primary: ACK(非阻塞)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Client\n    participant Primary\n    participant Replica\n    Note over Primary,Replica: 同步复制\n    Client-&gt;&gt;Primary: WRITE\n    Primary-&gt;&gt;Replica: 转发 WAL\n    Replica--&gt;&gt;Primary: ACK 已持久化\n    Primary--&gt;&gt;Client: COMMIT 成功\n    Note over Primary,Replica: 异步复制\n    Client-&gt;&gt;Primary: WRITE\n    Primary--&gt;&gt;Client: COMMIT 成功\n    Primary-&gt;&gt;Replica: 后台转发 WAL\n    Replica--&gt;&gt;Primary: ACK(非阻塞)</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>同步复制</th>\n<th>异步复制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RPO</td>\n<td>0（零数据丢失）</td>\n<td>&gt; 0（复制延迟窗口内的数据可能丢失）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写入延迟</td>\n<td>高——需等待网络往返 + 副本磁盘 I/O</td>\n<td>低——仅本地持久化后即返回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>距离适用性</td>\n<td>短距离（&lt; 300km，RTT &lt; 5ms）</td>\n<td>全球（无距离限制）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>故障切换速度</td>\n<td>快——副本已完全同步</td>\n<td>需要追赶重放（catch-up replay）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>吞吐量影响</td>\n<td>显著——每次写入都等待确认</td>\n<td>最小——主节点不阻塞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型用途</td>\n<td>同可用区/同区域 HA 副本</td>\n<td>跨区域 DR 副本、读副本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"延迟的物理极限\">延迟的物理极限</h3><p>光在光纤中的传播速度约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{fiber} \\approx 2 \\times 10^8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7692em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ib</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> m/s。两个区域间的最小往返时间（RTT）受物理距离限制：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RTT_{min} = \\frac{2d}{c_{fiber}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3435em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ib</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如 AWS us-east-1（弗吉尼亚）到 eu-west-1（爱尔兰）距离约 5500km，理论最小 RTT 约 55ms，实际测量约 85–95ms。同步复制在这一链路上意味着每次写入都增加 ~90ms 延迟——对于写密集型 OLTP 系统，这可能导致吞吐量下降超过 50%。</p>\n<p><strong>工程结论：同步复制仅适用于 RTT &lt; 5–10ms 的距离</strong>（通常为同城双活或同区域跨可用区）。跨区域/跨洲场景必须接受异步复制及其带来的非零 RPO。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复制拓扑\">复制拓扑</h2><h3 id=\"单主复制-single-leader\">单主复制（Single-Leader）</h3><p>最常见的拓扑：一个主节点接受所有写入，通过 WAL（Write-Ahead Log）或 binlog 将变更流式传输到一个或多个副本。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>优势</strong>：无冲突、强一致性可保证、实现成熟</li>\n<li><strong>局限</strong>：写入瓶颈在单节点、主节点故障需切换</li>\n<li><strong>云实现</strong>：AWS RDS Multi-AZ、Azure SQL Geo-Replication、GCP Cloud SQL HA</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"多主复制-multi-leader\">多主复制（Multi-Leader）</h3><p>多个节点均可接受写入，变更通过双向复制在节点间传播。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>优势</strong>：就近写入（低延迟）、无单点写瓶颈</li>\n<li><strong>局限</strong>：必须处理写冲突（下文详述）</li>\n<li><strong>云实现</strong>：DynamoDB Global Tables、Azure Cosmos DB Multi-Region Writes、CockroachDB</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"无主复制-leaderless\">无主复制（Leaderless）</h3><p>所有节点对等，客户端向多个节点写入，通过 quorum 机制确定一致性级别。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>优势</strong>：极高可用性、无需选举</li>\n<li><strong>局限</strong>：读修复（read repair）和反熵（anti-entropy）的复杂度</li>\n<li><strong>云实现</strong>：Apache Cassandra、ScyllaDB</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"云平台复制实现\">云平台复制实现</h2><h3 id=\"aws-aurora-global-database\">AWS：Aurora Global Database</h3><p>Aurora 的分布式存储架构将复制下沉到存储层：存储卷被切割为 10GB 的保护组（Protection Group），每组在 3 个可用区中保持 6 个副本（4/6 quorum 写、3/6 quorum 读）。跨区域复制通过专用的存储层复制通道实现，典型 RPO &lt; 1 秒。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>Aurora Multi-AZ</th>\n<th>Aurora Global Database</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>复制模式</td>\n<td>同步（存储层 quorum）</td>\n<td>异步（跨区域）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RPO</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>&lt; 1 秒（典型）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>故障切换 RTO</td>\n<td>&lt; 30 秒（自动）</td>\n<td>&lt; 1 分钟（手动/计划）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大读副本区域</td>\n<td>同区域 15 个</td>\n<td>5 个次区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写入延迟影响</td>\n<td>无（quorum 同区域）</td>\n<td>无（异步不阻塞主写入）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"aws-dynamodb-global-tables\">AWS：DynamoDB Global Tables</h3><p>DynamoDB Global Tables 提供主主（active-active）复制——每个副本区域都可读可写。2026 年支持两种一致性模式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>MREC（Multi-Region Eventual Consistency）</strong>：默认模式，异步复制，last-writer-wins 冲突解决，典型复制延迟 &lt; 1 秒</li>\n<li><strong>MRSC（Multi-Region Strong Consistency）</strong>：2025 年发布，同步复制到至少一个其他区域后才确认写入，RPO = 0，但写入延迟增加跨区域 RTT</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"azure-cosmos-db-多区域写入\">Azure：Cosmos DB 多区域写入</h3><p>Cosmos DB 支持多区域主主写入，提供五种一致性级别供选择（Strong → Bounded Staleness → Session → Consistent Prefix → Eventual）。跨区域写冲突通过 LWW（Last Writer Wins）或自定义冲突解决策略处理。</p>\n<h3 id=\"gcp-cloud-spanner\">GCP：Cloud Spanner</h3><p>Cloud Spanner 是唯一提供全球强一致性事务的托管数据库——基于 TrueTime（原子钟 + GPS）实现全球分布式 Paxos。每次写入等待 quorum 确认，跨区域部署的写入延迟通常在 10–20ms（依区域距离）。适用于需要全球强一致性但愿意为此支付延迟代价的场景（如全球金融系统）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复制延迟监控\">复制延迟监控</h2><p>异步复制必然存在复制延迟（replication lag）——副本落后主节点的时间差。这个延迟直接等于故障切换时的实际 RPO：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RPO_{actual} = ReplicaLag_{at\\_failure\\_time}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0614em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">im</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>监控复制延迟是灾备准备度的关键指标：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>AWS</strong>：CloudWatch <code>ReplicaLag</code> 指标（RDS/Aurora），<code>ReplicationLatency</code>（DynamoDB Global Tables）</li>\n<li><strong>Azure</strong>：<code>replication_lag</code> 诊断指标（Azure Database），<code>ReplicationLatency</code>（Cosmos DB）</li>\n<li><strong>GCP</strong>：<code>replica_lag</code> 指标（Cloud SQL），Spanner 无延迟（同步）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>告警阈值建议</strong>：当复制延迟超过声明 RPO 的 50% 时触发 warning，超过 80% 触发 critical。持续超标意味着要么写入压力超出复制带宽，要么网络质量恶化——两者都需要立即调查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冲突解决策略\">冲突解决策略</h2><p>多主复制不可避免地面临写冲突——同一数据项在不同节点被并发修改。常见的解决策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LWW（Last Writer Wins）</td>\n<td>按时间戳选择最新写入</td>\n<td>简单、确定性、无需应用改造</td>\n<td>静默丢弃较早写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本向量（Vector Clock）</td>\n<td>检测因果关系，标记真正冲突</td>\n<td>不丢弃无冲突写入</td>\n<td>真正冲突需应用层解决</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CRDT（Conflict-free Replicated Data Types）</td>\n<td>数据结构本身保证合并确定性</td>\n<td>无冲突、高可用</td>\n<td>仅适用于特定数据模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用层合并</td>\n<td>自定义业务逻辑决定合并结果</td>\n<td>语义最正确</td>\n<td>实现复杂、需维护</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>DynamoDB Global Tables（MREC 模式）默认使用 LWW——如果业务无法接受静默丢弃写入，需要在应用层实现幂等性检查或使用 MRSC 模式。Cosmos DB 允许通过存储过程注册自定义冲突解决器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"变更数据捕获-cdc\">变更数据捕获（CDC）</h2><p>CDC 是一种将数据库变更事件流式输出到外部系统的技术，常用于：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>将 OLTP 数据库变更近实时同步到分析系统</li>\n<li>跨异构数据库的复制（如 MySQL → PostgreSQL）</li>\n<li>事件驱动架构中的数据同步</li>\n</ul>\n<p>主流实现：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Debezium</strong>：开源 CDC 平台，基于数据库日志（binlog/WAL/change stream）</li>\n<li><strong>AWS DMS</strong>：托管 CDC 服务，支持跨引擎、跨区域持续复制</li>\n<li><strong>Azure Data Factory / Change Feed</strong>：Cosmos DB 原生 change feed + ADF 管道</li>\n</ul>\n<p>CDC 的灾备应用：当主数据库的原生复制能力不满足跨平台/跨云的 DR 需求时，CDC 提供了一种灵活的替代方案——将变更流导入到目标平台的数据库中，形成近实时的异构副本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"网络成本与优化\">网络成本与优化</h2><p>跨区域/跨可用区的数据传输是复制的隐性成本大户：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>跨可用区</strong>：AWS 双向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.02</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>B</mi><mtext>（入</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.02/GB（入</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.02/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">GB</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（入</span></span></span></span></span>0.01 + 出 $0.01）</li>\n<li><strong>跨区域</strong>：AWS 出站 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.02</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>B</mi><mtext>（部分高价区域如新加坡可达</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.02/GB（部分高价区域如新加坡可达</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.02/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">GB</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（部分高价区域如新加坡可达</span></span></span></span></span>0.09/GB）</li>\n<li><strong>高吞吐场景成本爆炸</strong>：一个 3 节点 Kafka 集群在 100 MiB/s 吞吐下，仅跨可用区流量月成本可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">14,000–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000–</span></span></span></span></span>24,000</li>\n</ul>\n<p>优化策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>压缩复制流（WAL 压缩可降低 60–80% 传输量）</li>\n<li>合并小事务批量传输</li>\n<li>选择同区域内复制（零额外网络费）满足 HA 需求，仅 DR 副本跨区域</li>\n<li>评估 S3 Express One Zone 等新型存储减少跨可用区复制</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>数据复制是将 RPO 从小时级压缩到秒级/零的技术手段，但它不是免费午餐——每一步压缩都以延迟增加、一致性复杂度上升、网络成本扩大为代价。选择同步还是异步、单主还是多主、LWW 还是 CRDT，取决于业务能容忍的 RPO 与愿意支付的延迟/成本代价。当数据已经持续复制到目标区域后，下一个问题是如何在故障发生时从这些副本中恢复——这就是<a href=\"storage-recovery-techniques\">存储恢复技术</a>要解决的问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据复制与同步技术","id":"数据复制与同步技术"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"同步复制与异步复制：核心权衡","id":"同步复制与异步复制-核心权衡"},{"level":3,"text":"延迟的物理极限","id":"延迟的物理极限"},{"level":2,"text":"复制拓扑","id":"复制拓扑"},{"level":3,"text":"单主复制（Single-Leader）","id":"单主复制-single-leader"},{"level":3,"text":"多主复制（Multi-Leader）","id":"多主复制-multi-leader"},{"level":3,"text":"无主复制（Leaderless）","id":"无主复制-leaderless"},{"level":2,"text":"云平台复制实现","id":"云平台复制实现"},{"level":3,"text":"AWS：Aurora Global Database","id":"aws-aurora-global-database"},{"level":3,"text":"AWS：DynamoDB Global Tables","id":"aws-dynamodb-global-tables"},{"level":3,"text":"Azure：Cosmos DB 多区域写入","id":"azure-cosmos-db-多区域写入"},{"level":3,"text":"GCP：Cloud Spanner","id":"gcp-cloud-spanner"},{"level":2,"text":"复制延迟监控","id":"复制延迟监控"},{"level":2,"text":"冲突解决策略","id":"冲突解决策略"},{"level":2,"text":"变更数据捕获（CDC）","id":"变更数据捕获-cdc"},{"level":2,"text":"网络成本与优化","id":"网络成本与优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"备份策略与实施","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/disaster-recovery-business-continuity/data-protection/backup-strategies"},"next":{"title":"存储恢复技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/disaster-recovery-business-continuity/data-protection/storage-recovery-techniques"}}